=Predict clinical risks for this resident.

RESIDENT DATA:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize & Validate Input').item.json) }}

HEALTH ASSESSMENT:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Health Monitoring Agent').item.json.output) }}

Return fallRisk as a 0-100 percentage (weigh fallDetected, gait/steps, age, stress, sleep). Return heartRisk, sleepRisk and activityRisk each as Low, Medium or High.

=Determine whether this resident is in a medical emergency.

RESIDENT DATA:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize & Validate Input').item.json) }}

HEALTH ASSESSMENT:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Health Monitoring Agent').item.json.output) }}

RISK PREDICTION:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Risk Prediction Agent').item.json.output) }}

Set emergency true only for genuinely urgent situations (e.g. confirmed fall, critical SpO2/heart rate, critical health). If emergency is true, provide priority, reason, immediateAction, hospitalRecommendation and emergencyContactRecommendation. If false, set priority to "None" and return short "Not required" style values for the action fields.

=Generate personalized care recommendations for this resident.

RESIDENT DATA:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize & Validate Input').item.json) }}

HEALTH ASSESSMENT:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Health Monitoring Agent').item.json.output) }}

RISK PREDICTION:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Risk Prediction Agent').item.json.output) }}

Return a recommendations array covering Diet, Exercise, Hydration, Medication (a reminder honoring medicationTaken), Sleep advice and a Doctor recommendation. Each item must have a category and a concrete, actionable recommendation.

=Write a professional caregiver report for this resident.

RESIDENT DATA:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Normalize & Validate Input').item.json) }}

HEALTH ASSESSMENT:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Health Monitoring Agent').item.json.output) }}

RISK PREDICTION:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Risk Prediction Agent').item.json.output) }}

EMERGENCY STATUS:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Emergency Agent').item.json.output) }}

RECOMMENDATIONS:
{{ JSON.stringify($('Recommendation Agent').item.json.output) }}

Produce a clear caregiverReport with sections: Current Status, Risk, Summary, Recommendations, and Next Checkup. Also return nextCheckup as a short timeframe.

